WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Oh my God, we're back again.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.500
Through the ages...

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.100
They've survived it all.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.500
We used to have adventures all the time.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.400
Now we're all slowing down.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.900
Do you need help crossing the stream?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Excuse me?

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.700
I need to earn my Helping the Elderly badge.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.100
Hey!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.700
But now...

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.300
Is that Rudy?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.700
Rudy, my cousin with the debilitating overbite?

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.918
Or Rudy, the most terrifying dinosaur in the lost

00:00:25.918 --> 00:00:26.300
world?

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.600
That's the one.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.662
their greatest adventure ever is about to be

00:00:30.662 --> 00:00:31.200
hatched.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.500
An egg!

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.400
Rudy's species is nearly extinct.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.600
The Carnos want to take out the eggs?

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.500
Destroy the lost world.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.115
Then we're all gonna make sure this egg gets to

00:00:41.115 --> 00:00:42.100
the nesting grounds.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.000
We are?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.800
The herd is back in action, baby.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:47.300
Everybody!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.055
We'll have to do an arduous ascent to the top of

00:00:51.055 --> 00:00:52.200
an active volcano!

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.000
No!

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.900
Don't worry, you'll make it.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.400
Probably.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.300
Please tell me you have a plan B.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.600
I didn't even have a plan A.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.300
How many times have things felt impossible?

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.500
But we got through it because we did it together.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.200
This is the same thing.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.000
All right.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.100
Oh, this will be a nice memory.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.400
Would you please cut this dingleberry off?

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.500
Everybody.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.700
Oh, this looks fun.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.100
Look, it's the dimwit of the opera.

